  "post_content": "<p>El ballet del Centro de Estudios Musicales de Onda ha ofrecido esta tarde en la Residencia de Ancianos Monse&ntilde;or Fernando Ferr&iacute;s una versi&oacute;n reducida del Bel&eacute;n que interprestaron el pasado s&aacute;bado, en doble sesi&oacute;n, en el Teatro M&oacute;naco.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2011/12/IMG_5495.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Ha presentado el acto la concejala de Atenci&oacute;n a Mayores, Maribel Raigada, a la que acompa&ntilde;aba la reina de la Fira d&#39;Onda 2011, Chari Aguilella Ribes.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/balletancianosbelen/img_5482.jpg\" alt=\"img_5482\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/balletancianosbelen/img_5484.jpg\" alt=\"img_5484\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/balletancianosbelen/img_5485.jpg\" alt=\"img_5485\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/balletancianosbelen/img_5486.jpg\" alt=\"img_5486\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/balletancianosbelen/img_5487.jpg\" alt=\"img_5487\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/balletancianosbelen/img_5488.jpg\" alt=\"img_5488\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/balletancianosbelen/img_5489.jpg\" alt=\"img_5489\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/balletancianosbelen/img_5490.jpg\" alt=\"img_5490\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r